@title EMC fix-it: ask the analog wire to leave the shared duct, preview and apply
@area Cabinet
@sizes 1366x768 1920x1080
# The fixture has a second duct below the devices. Check > EMC check lists EMC-01 (motor and analog wires in one duct) with "Preview: Route the wire in another duct if one reaches both ends". The preview re-routes a copy: EMC-01 goes. Apply is one undo step. The pictures are the evidence.
open qa/fixtures/emc-cabinet-two-ducts.novo
wait 20
key ctrl+k
wait 6
text emc check
wait 8
key Enter
wait 30
expect "Preview: Route the wire in another duct"
click_text "Preview: Route the wire in another duct" #1
wait 10
expect "Preview on a copy of the project"
expect "Clears EMC-01"
shot 01-preview
check_layout
click_text "Apply (one undo step)" #1
wait 15
expect "Wire asked to stay out of the duct"
expect_not "Preview on a copy of the project"
shot 02-applied
check_layout
